# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# npoint.io Setup (for Reviews feature)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# STEP 1: Go to https://npoint.io
# STEP 2: In the editor, paste exactly this:
#            {"reviews":[]}
#         Then click SAVE
# STEP 3: Copy the ID from the URL
#         e.g. if URL is https://www.npoint.io/docs/abc123def456
#              your BIN ID is: abc123def456
# STEP 4: (Optional) Add a secret token in npoint.io settings
#         to prevent others from editing your data
# STEP 5: Copy THIS file, rename it to just ".env" (no .example)
#         and fill in your values below
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

VITE_NPOINT_BIN_ID=paste_your_bin_id_here
VITE_NPOINT_SECRET=paste_your_secret_here_or_delete_this_line
